// The camera's numbers. Every field not written here takes the engine's default (the numbers the
// camera always had); the only change is the fit (R4): locked on to a point high on a big body (the
// colossus's horn), the view turns up from the player as far as it takes to keep the point in frame,
// and never so far that the player's feet leave it. A target the frame already holds (any body of
// a person's height) is framed exactly as without it.
{
    "default": (
        framing: (fit: Some(())),
    ),
}
